  "translation": "Na sapos man i kirap long bilong painim yu, na long lukautim ⟨את⟩ laip bilong yu, bai laip bilong bikman bilong mi i stap olsem paket i binis long paket bilong laip, wantaim ⟨את⟩ Yahwe Elohim bilong yu; na ⟨את⟩ laip bilong ol birua bilong yu bai ⟨em⟩ i trowe i go ausait, olsem long namel bilong hul bilong han bilong rop bilong trowe ston.",
